00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.443
I had no idea what I was doing.
-No idea what she was doing.

00:14:04.443 --> 00:14:06.312
No, no. You were just being you
and you go, "I didn't know.

00:14:06.312 --> 00:14:07.512
I'd even start this rumor."

00:14:07.512 --> 00:14:09.682
-And I didn't know if she
was on the soundtrack,

00:14:09.682 --> 00:14:12.651
