in "The Hunger Games: The Ballad
of Songbirds &amp; Snakes."

00:19:21.727 --> 00:19:22.761
Take a look.

00:19:22.761 --> 00:19:25.330
-Everything is about winning.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.899
If not the games now,
then the crowd.

00:19:27.899 --> 00:19:31.336
Lucy Gray won't survive
a minute inside that arena.

00:19:31.336 --> 00:19:34.907
So that means we have to make
every second before then count.

00:19:34.907 --> 00:19:37.141
We'll get her to sing again.

00:19:37.141 --> 00:19:39.844
-I wouldn't sing a note
for you if I was her.

00:19:39.844 --> 00:19:43.414
I wouldn't do anything at all,
unless I could trust you.

00:19:43.414 --> 00:19:45.216
-She's District, Tigris.

00:19:45.216 --> 00:19:47.652
She knows we hate her,
and she wants us dead.

00:19:47.652 --> 00:19:49.921
How am I supposed to get her
to trust me?

00:19:49.921 --> 00:19:51.990
-Imagine it was your name
that they pulled

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:54.459
and you had been ripped
from your home.

00:19:54.459 --> 00:19:55.527
I'd just want to know that

00:19:55.527 --> 00:19:57.896
somebody still cared about me
out here.

00:19:57.896 --> 00:20:01.466
Don't discount her just
because she's District, Corio.

00:20:01.466 --> 00:20:04.169
You might have more in common
with her than you think.

00:20:04.169 --> 00:20:06.170
[ Dramatic music intensifies ]

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:07.305
-Yes!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:20:07.305 --> 00:20:09.074
Hunter Schafer, everybody!

